          "short": "$3x^2$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x^5}{x^3}&=3x^{5-3}\\\\\\frac{3x^5}{x^3}&=3x^2\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
